Package: dogi
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: oksyd <oksyd@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIB_DEPENDS@, systemd, udev
Recommends: x11-utils
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/oksyd/dogi
Description: Logitech mouse configuration for Linux
 Dogi provides a desktop interface, direct HID++ device access, and local
 runtime actions for supported Logitech mice.
